        name: "Icy",
        description: Some("Any airless icy world, from Callisto to Europa to Pluto: three series of craters on ice darkened in places by a lag of rock and organics, young resurfaced plains that erase the oldest craters, and crossing lineae. Crater densities, the shares of plains and lag, the lineae\'s strength and the colors are parameters. Its \"height\" layer is the relief about zero, for a host to light."),
